  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Your model weapons deal more damage (Force Demolisher 2d6, Thunder Pulse 1d10, Lightning Launcher 2d6 - the module swaps the die). <strong>Dreadnaught:</strong> Giant Stature can make you Huge (asked), with Advantage on STR checks and saves. <strong>Guardian:</strong> when a Huge or smaller creature ends its turn within 30 ft, the module offers your Reaction - STR save (your spell DC) or it's pulled up to 25 ft toward you, and you can attack it if it ends within 5 ft. <strong>Infiltrator:</strong> creatures damaged by your Lightning Launcher glimmer (Disadvantage on attacks against you until your next turn), and the Bonus Action flight gives a Fly Speed of twice your Speed this turn. The Reaction and the flight use INT modifier uses per Long Rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
